Date: Sun, 14 Jun 2026 23:29:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Implement Agent OS spine, workflow/runtime, cockpit operating
 map, and remove Google Fonts build dependency
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

### Motivation

- Establish a typed, safe Agent OS surface and runtime so tasks/workflows can be routed, persisted, and inspected without enabling external/publish actions.
- Provide deterministic safety gates for owner/Claude review, NOT_WIRED / DRAFT_ONLY / MANUAL realities, and protected-source/unsettled-season blocking.
- Make the repo buildable in offline/Codex environments by removing `next/font/google` network fetches and capturing git environment info for reproducible setup.

### Description

- Added a typed Agent OS implementation and registry (`apps/web/lib/agents/*`) plus health summary and queue/dispatch facades to enforce owner/claude gates and not-wire semantics.
- Implemented task/router/store/runtime and seed tasks (`apps/web/lib/tasks/*`) with a Prisma-backed store that falls back to in-memory when the DB delegate is unavailable.
- Added a governed workflow registry, event store, planner, runtime, and workflow→task bridge (`apps/web/lib/workflows/*`) that block unsafe actions (publish/send/spend/deploy/scrape/public-enable/change-weight).
- Implemented cockpit operating map and Jarvis operating assessment and surfaced an `OperatingRuntimeZone` in `/cockpit` to report agent reality, top risks, owner decisions, and review queues (`apps/web/lib/cockpit/*`, `/apps/web/app/cockpit/page.tsx`).
- Built historical-NFL safety primitives (player/team/game resolvers, settled-season guard, stat coverage auditor, projection feature registry) and market/memory/calibration helpers (`apps/web/lib/nfl/*`, `statking/*`, `market/*`, `memory/*`, `calibration/*`, `projections/*`).
- Fixed offline build by removing `next/font/google` imports and Google font preconnect from `app/layout.tsx` and relying on existing design-token stacks, and added `CODEX_REPO_LOCK.md` recording git environment from `scripts/morning-setup.mjs`.
- Added comprehensive tests and handoff docs and summaries under `apps/web/__tests__` and `handoff/*` capturing implementation notes and known weaknesses.

### Testing

- Regenerated Prisma client with `npm run db:generate` and ran typecheck via `npm run typecheck`, which passed across workspaces.
- Built the app with `npm run build` after removing Google Fonts network fetch, and the build now passes in the Codex environment.
- Executed the new and updated test suites with `npm run test --workspace=apps/web` (including `agent-os-operating-spine.test.ts`, `agent-os-runtime.test.ts`, `homepage-doctrine-hero.test.ts`, and `jarvis-operating-runtime-cockpit.test.ts`), with final runs reporting success (29–30 tests passing across the relevant suites).
- Noted and fixed two initial failures: a font-network build failure (resolved by removing `next/font/google`) and a draft-action mismatch in seed tasks (fixed to `DRAFT`), after which tests passed.
